```console
$ hiero --help
Hieronymus local-first translation memory manager

Usage: hiero [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  start             Start the daemon (no-op if already running — the binary IS the daemon)
  status            Show daemon status
  stop              Stop the daemon (HTTP POST /shutdown)
  config            Open the web console
  doctor            Run system diagnostics
  series[..]
  session[..]
  concept[..]
